@startuml UML-PUBLICATION-ACQUISITION-FLOW
title KnowledgeOS — Publication Acquisition Flow
caption Architecture V3.0

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor User
participant "KnowledgeOS Client" as Client
database "Selective Local Library" as Local
participant "KnowledgeOS Server on NAS" as Server
database "NAS Master Library" as Master

User -> Client : Browse Master Catalog
Client -> Server : Query catalog
Server -> Master : Read catalog metadata
Master --> Server : Catalog results
Server --> Client : Catalog results

User -> Client : Acquire selected publication
Client -> Server : Request publication by stable identity
Server -> Master : Read source publication and master metadata
Master --> Server : Publication payload
Server --> Client : Stream publication payload
Client -> Local : Validate and persist local publication
Client --> User : Publication available offline

note over Client, Master
  Acquisition is one-way content delivery.
  It is not NAS replication and does not upload personal state.
end note

footer KnowledgeOS Architecture | UML | Version 3.0
@enduml
